This page compares the questions [nouls](https://github.com/benomahony/nouls) and zanity ask a model.
Generated by `bench/parity/parity.py` on 2026-10-17, against zanity `7c4a2e5`.

# Inference

nouls asks a model 30 named questions and one question per error-catalogue family, 475 in all. `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` was not set, so neither nouls nor `zanity check --infer` ran; this compares the questions. The list comes from nouls' own config loader. A match means zanity asks a question for the same problem, not that both answer it the same way.

| nouls question | zanity --infer question | In zanity |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `boundary_error` | `boundary-error` | [✓ yes]($text.attrs('badge','pass')) |
| `check_then_act` | `check-then-act` | [✓ yes]($text.attrs('badge','pass')) |
| `cryptic_error` | `cryptic-error` | [✓ yes]($text.attrs('badge','pass')) |
